      "title": "WORKFLOW INSTRUCTIONS",
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "Note"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "FREE LOCAL PORTRAIT VIDEO — Quality\n\nLoad a reference image first. This workflow animates ordinary clothed portraits.\nCenter crop preserves proportions but can cut off the head or hands. Inspect PREPARED REFERENCE before judging the output. For wide photographs, change both resize and latent dimensions to a landscape pair.\nPreview: 480×768, 49 frames, 16 steps (~2 seconds).\nQuality: 480×768, 121 frames, 30 steps (~5 seconds).\nHigher resolution: 576×896, 121 frames, 30 steps; more VRAM/time, not verified.\nCompare preview and quality using the same image, prompt, and fixed seed. Different frame counts/resolution can still change motion.\nTiled decode: 512 tile, 64 overlap, 32 temporal, 8 temporal overlap. If seams appear compare regular VAE Decode; tiled decoding is not a quality enhancer.\nAll models reuse the original workflow selections. No paid API, subscription, new extensions, or automatic downloads.\nNo interpolation, face restoration, style LoRA, or forced sharpening: these have not been validated for this model.\nSaveVideo embeds workflow metadata with metadata enabled in ComfyUI. Default model settings do not guarantee exact identity.\nGraph/schema checked offline. Generation, VRAM fit, temporal stability and codec output require testing on your PC."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "FREE LOCAL PORTRAIT VIDEO — Quality\n\nLoad a reference image first. This workflow animates ordinary clothed portraits.\nCenter crop preserves proportions but can cut off the head or hands. Inspect PREPARED REFERENCE before judging the output. For wide photographs, change both resize and latent dimensions to a landscape pair.\nPreview: 480×768, 49 frames, 16 steps (~2 seconds).\nQuality: 480×768, 121 frames, 30 steps (~5 seconds).\nHigher resolution: 576×896, 121 frames, 30 steps; more VRAM/time, not verified.\nCompare preview and quality using the same image, prompt, and fixed seed. Different frame counts/resolution can still change motion.\nTiled decode: 512 tile, 64 overlap, 32 temporal, 8 temporal overlap. If seams appear compare regular VAE Decode; tiled decoding is not a quality enhancer.\nAll models reuse the original workflow selections. No paid API, subscription, new extensions, or automatic downloads.\nNo interpolation, face restoration, style LoRA, or forced sharpening: these have not been validated for this model.\nSaveVideo embeds workflow metadata with metadata enabled in ComfyUI. Default model settings do not guarantee exact identity.\nGraph/schema checked offline. Generation, VRAM fit, temporal stability and codec output require testing on your PC."
